# Project Agent Loadout — one kebab-case agent ID per line, # for comments
#
# 用法:
#   1. 把本文件重命名为 .enabled
#   2. 添加本项目需要的 agent ID（必须匹配 <agent-dev-pool>/<agent-id>.md 和 frontmatter `name:`）
#   3. 下次 Claude Code 启动时，SessionStart hook 自动从共享池复制缺失 agent 到本目录
#   4. 如果本目录已经有同名 agent 文件，项目本地版本优先，不会被共享池覆盖
#
# 可用 agent 清单（44 个）查询:
#   ls <agent-dev-pool>/
#
# 已经在 L2 全局加载的（无需在此添加）:
#   project-manager-senior, agents-orchestrator, backend-architect, frontend-developer,
#   code-reviewer, reality-checker, minimal-change-engineer, git-workflow-master
#
# L3 模板默认 11 个（已在本目录文件存在，无需在此添加）:
#   engineering-ai-engineer, engineering-database-optimizer, engineering-data-engineer,
#   engineering-incident-response-commander, engineering-sre, lsp-index-engineer,
#   project-management-jira-workflow-steward, specialized-mcp-builder,
#   testing-accessibility-auditor, testing-performance-benchmarker,
#   testing-test-results-analyzer

# === 示例: 取消注释你需要的 ===

# security-engineer            # auth / token / secrets / OWASP
# api-tester                   # API 健康检查 / contract
# evidence-collector           # UI / 浏览器证据
# devops-automator             # docker / CI/CD / monitoring
# technical-writer             # 文档密集 sprint
# codebase-onboarding-engineer # 进陌生 codebase 区
# mobile-app-builder           # iOS / Android / cross-platform
# software-architect           # 系统级架构设计
# rapid-prototyper             # 快速 PoC / MVP
# senior-developer             # premium 全栈实装
